# Architecture

This is a CLI VLESS configuration checker. Python orchestrates Xray subprocesses; it does not implement VLESS.

## Module layout

```
src/
├── __main__.py   # `python -m src` entry
├── main.py       # CLI, progress, output, concurrency
├── vless.py      # VLESS URL parsing and Xray config generation
├── xray.py       # Xray subprocess lifecycle
└── checker.py    # Health check (port, IP, GeoIP)
```

## Rules

- Keep orchestration in `main.py` thin — delegate checks to `checker.py`.
- Xray process management stays in `xray.py`.
- VLESS parsing and Xray config building stay in `vless.py`.
- Use `asyncio.Semaphore` for concurrency — no custom worker pool.
